## 9. Containerization Flow

The complete backend flow is:

``` text
Mohalla Backend source
        |
        v
Docker build
        |
        +--> Stage 1: Node 20 Alpine
        |       |
        |       +--> copy package files
        |       +--> npm ci --omit=dev
        |       |
        |       +--> production node_modules
        |
        v
Stage 2: Node 20 Alpine
        |
        +--> copy production node_modules
        +--> copy application source
        +--> create /app/logs
        +--> change ownership
        +--> switch to node user
        |
        v
npm start
        |
        v
Backend listening on :8000
        |
        v
Kubernetes Service
```